      "solution": "Direct main lookups a-f: sqrt5.1=2.258, sqrt6=2.449, sqrt48=6.928, sqrt2.07=1.439, sqrt31.5=5.612, sqrt54.8=7.403 as table approximations. Additive IV corrected lookups g-l: sqrt7.153=2.674+0.001=2.675; sqrt28.04=5.292+0.004=5.296; sqrt66.38=8.142+0.005=8.147; sqrt37.21=6.099+0.001=6.100; sqrt53.49=7.308+0.006=7.314; sqrt87.25=9.338+0.003=9.341. Authorized next-main routes would give 8.149-0.001=8.148 for66.38 and7.314-0.001=7.313 for53.49: rounded routes need not coincide. This draft explicitly selects addition, preserving actual supplied cells rather than direct-root substitutions."
