      ],
      "solution": "345=3.45*10^2 ->sqrt3.45 main1.857 *10=18.57.290=2.90*10^2 ->1.703*10=17.03.1281=12.81*10^2 ->(3.578+0.001)*10=35.79.3720=37.2*10^2 ->6.099*10=60.99.25740=2.574*10^4 ->(1.603+0.001)*100=160.4.0.351=35.1*10^-2 ->5.925*0.1=0.5925.0.0724=7.24*10^-2 ->2.691*0.1=0.2691.0.00425=42.5*10^-4 ->6.519*0.01=0.06519. All eight use actual captured main/correction values; no direct high-precision square root replaces a table computation."
